offset_bottom = 591.0
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Congrats on finishing your first sudoku! Only 80 more to go :)

Joking aside, you may notice two things about this puzzle:
- It looks the same as the previous puzzle
- There's no numbers

This is why there's a Valid Inputs section: puzzles [b]are not[/b] limited to just numbers! Letters and other symbols may appear as well.

